\newlabel{tab:time_transfer_expanded}{{R.9}{16}{Out-of-sample time-transfer test on 40 regions. THEMIS outperforms DELPHI-constant on 39 of 40 regions, reducing mean APE by $4.9$~pp and median APE by $4.7$~pp}{table.caption.11}{}}
